  "instructions": [
    "Combine ground turkey and ginger in a bowl.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix flour and water to form a dough.",
    "Knead the dough for 5 minutes.",
    "Roll out the dough to 1/4 inch thickness.",
    "Use a cookie cutter to cut out circles of dough.",
    "Place a tablespoon of the ground turkey mixture in the center of each circle.",
    "Fold the dough over the filling and press edges to seal.",
    "Bring a large pot of water to a boil and cook manti for 15 minutes.",
